      "hint": "Pick a fruit, or find a juice.",
      "pages": [
        {
          "text": "Two fruit, a sugar and a glass bottle make juice. Every juice has its own glass. You drink it like honey and keep the bottle. You can also make it in a fruit press, a Farmer's Delight cooking pot or with Create. Coconut water is different: crack a coconut open with a glass bottle in your other hand."
        },
        {
          "text": "Golden Carrot, Golden Apple and Enchanted Golden Apple juice give what the food gives. In Create, one fruit in the press gives 125 mB, so two fruit still make a bottle."
        },
