      "hint": "Find some juices first.",
      "pages": [
        {
          "text": "Put two bottled drinks together in the crafting grid and you get two of a mix. With Create, pour them into a basin with a mixer instead. The order does not matter. You can also try a honey bottle. Some mixes have two layers."
        },
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "in": [
                "alterra_kitchen:orange_juice",
                "alterra_kitchen:pomegranate_juice"
              ],
              "out": "alterra_kitchen:sunrise",
              "via": "minecraft:crafting_table",
              "text": "Orange juice and pomegranate juice make two Sunrises."
            }
          ],
          "text": "This is the only mix written down here. The rest are yours to find."
        },
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "in": [
                "alterra_kitchen:orange_juice",
                "alterra_kitchen:pomegranate_juice"
              ],
              "out": "alterra_kitchen:sunrise",
              "via": "create:mechanical_mixer",
              "text": "Pour both into a basin with a mixer, in any amounts: equal parts mix into the same amount of Sunrise."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
