    {
      "id": "secrets",
      "chapter": "kitchen",
      "title": "Secret Drinks",
      "icon": "alterra_kitchen:golden_orchard",
      "unlock": [],
      "hint": "",
      "pages": [
        {
          "text": "There are more drinks than anyone has written down. They are only made with Create: pour drinks into a basin with a mixer and see what comes out."
        },
        {
          "text": "The order does not matter. Most are two drinks, some are three, and some use milk."
        },
        {
          "text": "Every juice mixes with every other juice. That is a lot of drinks."
        },
        {
          "text": "The golden juices go with nearly everything, and the mix keeps what the golden juice gives you."
        },
        {
          "text": "A drink with ember or frost in it gets a spark or a crystal on top. Sun and gilded ones sparkle."
        },
        {
          "text": "The first drink in a mix decides most of the colour. The last one tints the bottom."
        },
        {
          "text": "Try the mixes too. A mix plus a juice, or a mix plus a mix, is a different drink again."
        },
        {
          "text": "Nothing in the recipe book or in JEI will tell you. Keep your own notes."
        }
      ]
    },
